{"id":"n14085-2-8","stage":2,"title":"실리다 · 被刊载","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14085-2-8-1","ko":"영화 광고에 실린 내 사진 봤니?","zh":"你看到电影广告里我的照片了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}},{"text":"광고에","meaning":"广告","explanation":"광고：广告；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"광고","audio":"/audio/3ac16375aaf1de633847.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62390","senseId":"1","lemma":"광고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"광고에","audio":"/audio/d1a3918b6348c82a7c25.mp3"}},{"text":"실린","meaning":"被刊载，被登载","explanation":"실리다：被刊载，被登载；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"실리다","audio":"/audio/1d65a16bd08db85a577c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14085","senseId":"2","lemma":"실리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실린","audio":"/audio/4d6f666724e48a2fcdfa.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"사진","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}},{"text":"봤니?","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤니","audio":"/audio/f1501c6cd4fb2c2f0d42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"3ac16375aaf1de63","term":"광고","zh":"广告","audio":"/audio/3ac16375aaf1de633847.mp3","entryId":"62390","definition":"通过电视或报纸等向人们广泛告知某些信息的宣传活动。","pronunciation":["광ː고"]},{"id":"1d65a16bd08db85a","term":"실리다","zh":"被刊载，被登载","audio":"/audio/1d65a16bd08db85a577c.mp3","entryId":"14085","definition":"文章或照片等在书或报纸等上印刷出来。","pronunciation":["실리다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/635f84a2178cc3749df4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14085-2-8-2","ko":"물론이지. 영화 광고에도 나오다니 대단해!","zh":"当然看了。居然出现在电影广告里，真了不起！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물론이지.","meaning":"当然，不用说","explanation":"물론：当然，不用说；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"물론","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89812","senseId":"1","lemma":"물론","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물론이지","audio":"/audio/8067e1d6097584747ac7.mp3"}},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}},{"text":"광고에도","meaning":"广告","explanation":"광고：广告；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"광고","audio":"/audio/3ac16375aaf1de633847.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62390","senseId":"1","lemma":"광고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"광고에도","audio":"/audio/b131a4c7da6bba450255.mp3"}},{"text":"나오다니","meaning":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","explanation":"나오다：被刊登，被播放，被记载；다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"4","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오다니","audio":"/audio/1ba3da2617fd85d33d4d.mp3"}},{"text":"대단해!","meaning":"很出色，很杰出","explanation":"대단하다：很出色，很杰出；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"대단하다","audio":"/audio/a89a72f50dfdf2daf4dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46607","senseId":"3","lemma":"대단하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대단해","audio":"/audio/5289ce59dbbfb7a98a8c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86ee58f45cccde99","term":"물론","zh":"当然，不用说","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3","entryId":"89812","definition":"没有必要说的。","pronunciation":["물론"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"3ac16375aaf1de63","term":"광고","zh":"广告","audio":"/audio/3ac16375aaf1de633847.mp3","entryId":"62390","definition":"通过电视或报纸等向人们广泛告知某些信息的宣传活动。","pronunciation":["광ː고"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在书籍、报纸、广播电视等上登载文章、画作或出现某种内容。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"a89a72f50dfdf2da","term":"대단하다","zh":"很出色，很杰出","audio":"/audio/a89a72f50dfdf2daf4dc.mp3","entryId":"46607","definition":"非常突出。","pronunciation":["대ː단하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6a8cfd3fbd0d92385ec4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.636,"sourc